          "to": "savan [v]",
          "note": "Finnish consonant gradation: intervocalic /p/ → [v] in weak grade. E.g., 'lapa' (blade) → 'lavan' (GEN), 'tapa' (manner) → 'tavan'. The pattern pp→p→v is systematic."
